WEBVTT

00:19.200 --> 00:22.900
<i>Gokusen</i>

00:23.170 --> 00:28.410
<i>How long has it been</i>
<i>since that day when we first met?</i>

00:28.580 --> 00:34.110
<i>So many good times and bad times</i>
<i>have come and gone since then.</i>

00:34.290 --> 00:39.450
<i>I know you can't make sense</i>
<i>of what I'm trying to say.</i>

00:39.620 --> 00:44.890
<i>But my true feelings for you</i>
<i>can never be put into words.</i>

00:45.200 --> 00:50.640
<i>Will you ever know how I feel?</i>
<i>Will you ever know what's going on inside me?</i>

00:50.840 --> 00:56.270
<i>If only we could live in a world where</i>
<i>you only have to be yourself and smile.</i>

00:56.440 --> 01:01.710
<i>Or is it always going to be like this?</i>
<i>Will we be able to go on like this?</i>

01:01.910 --> 01:09.620
<i>Even if you're far away, I want to</i>
<i>feel you in my heart, close to me.</i>

01:46.520 --> 01:47.390
What?

01:47.590 --> 01:51.430
Ms. Fujiyama finally snagged
some boys for her choir club?

01:51.560 --> 01:52.900
That's what I heard.

01:53.230 --> 01:55.890
They've been practicing
for the last few days.

01:56.030 --> 01:57.500
Holy...

01:57.670 --> 02:02.630
<i>SHIROKIN BOYS' CHOIR?</i>
<i>SA Y WHAT!?</i>

02:06.180 --> 02:08.650
<i>Music Room</i>

02:16.650 --> 02:17.850
Jeez...

02:20.160 --> 02:21.750
Listen to that falsetto...

02:21.860 --> 02:23.260
What kind of song is this?

02:23.360 --> 02:26.060
And where the hell did she find...

02:26.160 --> 02:27.890
...these boy-toys!

02:29.630 --> 02:31.970
She's certainly living up
to my expectations...

02:32.070 --> 02:33.400
Ms. Fujiyama!

02:33.610 --> 02:34.970
Principal!

02:35.710 --> 02:38.040
You wanted a choir club?

02:38.140 --> 02:39.170
Oh, no.

02:39.280 --> 02:42.740
I'm talking about how tough
and determined she is.

02:42.850 --> 02:43.610
Oh, right.

02:43.720 --> 02:47.310
She's created her own
little world in there.

02:47.420 --> 02:49.280
But that's not all, you see.

02:49.390 --> 02:49.910
Huh?

02:51.120 --> 02:53.750
I didn't hire Ms. Fujiyama just on...

02:53.860 --> 02:56.690
...the strength of her fair skin
and her gigantic breasts.

02:56.930 --> 02:59.160
The same goes for you,
Ms. Yamaguchi.

02:59.260 --> 03:00.660
Principal...

03:03.970 --> 03:06.840
P-p-pervert!

03:06.940 --> 03:08.070
Principal!

03:08.170 --> 03:10.970
I'm not finished treating
that boil on your derriere!

03:11.110 --> 03:12.940
You must come back here at once!

03:13.080 --> 03:15.140
Oh, that's right, that's right.

03:15.250 --> 03:18.080
I just couldn't stop myself
when I heard the singing...

03:18.180 --> 03:19.280
Couldn't stop! Couldn't stop!

03:22.120 --> 03:24.320
Oh, Ms. Yamaguchi...

03:27.660 --> 03:30.420
I'm glad you got some kids
to join your choir club.

03:30.560 --> 03:33.360
And they're all your type to boot, too!

03:33.530 --> 03:35.590
I can't do much with four, though...

03:36.000 --> 03:39.770
I guess I'm just going to have to cast
a wider net, regardless of looks.

03:40.870 --> 03:42.840
After all, beggars can't be choosers.

03:42.970 --> 03:44.910
Um, if you say so.

03:45.180 --> 03:46.940
Anyway, good luck to you!

03:47.050 --> 03:48.040
Thank you.

03:48.380 --> 03:49.010
Huh?

03:49.480 --> 03:50.070
Hey...

03:52.120 --> 03:53.180
Isn't that...

03:53.280 --> 03:53.980
Huh?

03:54.620 --> 03:55.990
Ichikawa!

03:56.820 --> 03:59.260
Why don't you join the choir club?

03:59.660 --> 04:01.150
Ichikawa...

04:01.390 --> 04:04.330
Dammit! I know he'd be a natural!

04:04.760 --> 04:07.820
Ms. Fujiyama's totally hung up
on outward appearances.

04:08.330 --> 04:10.820
What a sweet young thing...

04:11.240 --> 04:14.500
But it looked like he got
punched in the face...

04:21.180 --> 04:21.840
Jeez!

04:21.980 --> 04:23.540
What the hell is this?

04:23.650 --> 04:26.850
She's gotta be off her rocker,
that Fujiyama...

04:26.950 --> 04:31.050
Nobody would draw themselves
a set of boobs that huge.

04:31.190 --> 04:34.790
I heard a story about Fujiyama
from some guys in Class 2...

04:34.890 --> 04:35.360
Huh?

04:35.490 --> 04:38.020
She caused a scandal
at her old school...

04:38.130 --> 04:40.860
...trying to elope
with a junior high kid.

04:40.970 --> 04:41.760
Huh?

04:41.900 --> 04:43.370
No way!

04:43.500 --> 04:46.030
That's the reason
she got herself fired.

04:47.210 --> 04:48.570
No, you've got it wrong.

04:48.710 --> 04:52.300
I heard a junior high kid she was
fooling around with offed himself.

04:52.410 --> 04:52.880
Jesus!

04:53.010 --> 04:53.880
No...

04:53.980 --> 04:54.810
The way I heard it...

04:54.910 --> 04:58.870
She started dancing right in class,
and she was damn near butt-naked!

04:59.020 --> 05:00.420
Hmm...

05:00.790 --> 05:02.190
So to recap...

05:02.350 --> 05:03.620
There's elopement...

05:03.720 --> 05:04.880
Suicide...

05:05.120 --> 05:07.120
And dancing in the nude!

05:07.290 --> 05:08.760
You gotta be kidding me!

05:09.260 --> 05:10.190
Yankumi!

05:10.700 --> 05:11.560
You little...

05:11.930 --> 05:13.190
...sneaky-ass morons!

05:13.300 --> 05:16.290
You're like a bunch of old ladies
in a freakin' sewing circle!

05:16.400 --> 05:17.330
Holy shit!

05:17.540 --> 05:18.560
Run for it!

05:18.840 --> 05:20.530
If you bullshit like that again...

05:20.670 --> 05:24.570
I swear I'll rip you
all a new one, got that?

05:24.740 --> 05:26.870
Rip them a new one? Awesome.

05:26.980 --> 05:28.110
Oh, I'm sorry.

05:28.280 --> 05:30.340
They were trading
some crazy stories...

05:30.450 --> 05:33.040
You know, because they
think you're so sexy!

05:33.150 --> 05:34.590
It's all right, that's nothing.

05:34.690 --> 05:36.920
I don't give a rat's ass
about what they said.

05:37.020 --> 05:40.050
Besides, it's partly true, you know.

05:40.190 --> 05:41.990
What? Then you mean...

05:44.160 --> 05:46.060
You did dance in the...

05:46.160 --> 05:47.560
Not that part!

05:47.870 --> 05:49.090
Oh, never mind.

05:49.230 --> 05:50.790
I'll tell you about it some time...

05:50.900 --> 05:51.840
Okay...

05:58.540 --> 06:00.480
Ichikawa!

06:00.580 --> 06:02.510
Ready for my next move?

06:02.610 --> 06:04.310
Go easy on me, okay?

06:04.850 --> 06:06.720
Here it comes!

06:06.850 --> 06:09.580
Running neck-breaker!

06:14.590 --> 06:15.990
What's the big idea?

06:16.090 --> 06:16.750
Sorry!

06:16.860 --> 06:18.450
I just adore pro wrestling.

06:21.130 --> 06:22.660
That hurt, you moron!

06:23.170 --> 06:25.160
But we're pretending to wrestle, right?

06:25.340 --> 06:28.000
Of course it's gonna hurt if
you're the one getting hit.

06:28.770 --> 06:29.670
Shit!

06:31.210 --> 06:33.200
Come on, Ichikawa. Let's go.

06:34.050 --> 06:35.040
Wait up!

06:36.110 --> 06:37.100
Jeez...

06:37.480 --> 06:40.580
A kid that spineless isn't
going to last long here.

06:43.820 --> 06:46.810
That fragile-looking boy, Ichikawa...

06:46.990 --> 06:47.890
Uh-huh...

06:48.160 --> 06:50.030
Are the other boys bullying him?

06:53.800 --> 06:55.530
I'm not really sure.

06:56.630 --> 07:00.200
I've seen him with those
bruises on his face before.

07:00.370 --> 07:04.470
I've seen the other kids try pro
wrestling moves on him in class.

07:04.580 --> 07:08.030
And I think he should
stay away from them, but...

07:08.210 --> 07:10.550
He seems to gravitate to them.

07:13.780 --> 07:17.350
If only he'd talk to me about it,
I might be able to help.

07:17.660 --> 07:21.890
But no matter how hard I try to
approach him he refuses to talk.

07:22.190 --> 07:24.090
Oh, so that's why...

07:24.530 --> 07:25.290
Hmm?

07:25.700 --> 07:29.690
I meant, that's why you wanted
him to join the choir club.

07:31.000 --> 07:33.730
Well, it would be nice
if that came to pass.

07:33.910 --> 07:37.100
And besides, I did blow it once before.

07:37.680 --> 07:40.410
All right, I have to get
ready for my next class.

07:40.540 --> 07:41.910
See you later.

07:43.950 --> 07:45.680
"Blow it"?

07:46.550 --> 07:48.920
Eloping with her own student...

07:49.420 --> 07:51.180
N-no way...

07:51.460 --> 07:53.390
And finally, dancing in the nude!

07:53.560 --> 07:54.920
No, wait. That one...

07:55.030 --> 07:57.020
That one we can forget about.

07:57.130 --> 07:58.430
Mmm...

08:30.930 --> 08:31.950
Hey Ichikawa...

08:32.330 --> 08:34.390
We're gonna hang out
at my place again.

08:34.500 --> 08:35.630
You come too.

08:35.770 --> 08:36.560
Okay.

08:36.670 --> 08:39.640
Remember to bring your
toys with you, now.

08:39.770 --> 08:41.400
I will.

08:42.310 --> 08:44.740
That new game that
came out last week...

08:44.880 --> 08:47.140
That's the one I wanna play.

08:48.280 --> 08:49.340
Got that, Ichikawa?

08:49.450 --> 08:50.710
Know what we're saying?

08:50.850 --> 08:52.540
Yeah...

08:53.220 --> 08:54.380
Later, Ichikawa.

08:54.490 --> 08:55.780
We'll be waiting.

08:55.890 --> 08:57.750
Make sure you show up.

09:20.040 --> 09:21.540
Hey, that's the one!

09:21.710 --> 09:23.810
I had this game on my list, too.

09:24.820 --> 09:26.750
Looks like a lot of fun, huh?

09:27.180 --> 09:30.020
I'll get it, so
why don't we both play it?

09:31.820 --> 09:34.820
We can talk about things at my place.

09:36.330 --> 09:37.230
All right?

09:41.630 --> 09:42.930
Ichikawa!

09:46.740 --> 09:48.260
Ichikawa!

09:50.040 --> 09:52.340
Ichikawa, wait up!

09:53.540 --> 09:56.950
Ichikawa, I want you
to join the choir club!

09:57.080 --> 09:58.810
Ichikawa!

09:58.980 --> 10:02.040
Let's sing our hearts out after school!

10:02.150 --> 10:04.590
I said leave me the hell alone!

10:04.690 --> 10:06.380
I can't do it! I can't!

11:13.660 --> 11:15.560
Ms. Fujiyama...

11:16.490 --> 11:18.020
Who knew?

11:18.330 --> 11:21.630
I guess he's got muscles
on him somewhere, after all.

11:23.900 --> 11:26.370
<i>ODEN</i>

11:31.410 --> 11:32.710
The thing is...

11:35.050 --> 11:39.880
One of the students in my first class
tried to commit suicide.

11:48.360 --> 11:49.830
...yama.

11:53.430 --> 11:54.400
Right!

11:54.530 --> 11:57.900
My name is Fujiyama. I'm going
to be your homeroom teacher!

11:58.070 --> 11:59.630
Nice to meet you all!

12:02.210 --> 12:05.470
There was one really
cute boy in that class.

12:05.840 --> 12:08.070
He had such fair skin and was so slim.

12:08.250 --> 12:10.150
And such a sensitive face...

12:10.450 --> 12:13.420
He was only an eighth-grader...

12:13.520 --> 12:16.350
...which is 2 years younger
than I usually go for.

12:16.450 --> 12:17.820
What are you talking about?

12:18.090 --> 12:20.820
Was that boy being bullied?

12:23.360 --> 12:25.960
Well, I'm not really sure even now.

12:26.260 --> 12:29.170
I'd just started out
as a teacher, you know.

12:29.400 --> 12:32.060
He hung out with
a group of 4 or 5 boys.

12:32.170 --> 12:34.230
I thought they were getting along.

12:34.410 --> 12:36.500
Sure, the other boys teased him...

12:36.610 --> 12:39.080
But I never thought much of it...

12:39.640 --> 12:42.840
...because he always laughed with them.

12:45.450 --> 12:50.550
I never dreamed that it was such a torment
to him that actually wanted to die.

12:52.290 --> 12:56.250
One day, he swallowed all the
sleeping pills in his house.

12:56.460 --> 13:01.660
His parents found him and took him
to the hospital, so he survived.

13:02.900 --> 13:06.600
When I heard what had happened,
it felt like my heart had stopped.

13:06.770 --> 13:09.330
<i>Shirokin Hospital</i>

13:11.910 --> 13:13.740
What is the meaning of this?

13:13.940 --> 13:17.310
How could you not see that those
bullies were driving him to suicide?

13:17.450 --> 13:19.880
Fortunately, the doctors
were able to save him...

13:20.020 --> 13:23.250
But if he'd died, you'd have as
good as killed him yourselves!

13:23.350 --> 13:24.080
Yes...

13:24.190 --> 13:26.710
We deeply regret not
having recognized...

13:26.920 --> 13:29.920
This never would've happened if
it hadn't been for that trashy...

13:30.030 --> 13:31.790
...flaky homeroom teacher of his!

13:31.900 --> 13:35.160
I hear she's always turning
on the sexual charm in class!

13:35.270 --> 13:37.460
How can she call herself a teacher?

13:40.640 --> 13:43.400
Those are the words
they hurled at me...

13:43.540 --> 13:46.510
I ended up quitting after my first year.

13:53.020 --> 13:54.080
Thanks...

13:54.550 --> 13:57.520
But I didn't leave
because they criticized me.

13:57.760 --> 14:01.450
It was because I wasn't able to see
the pain that boy was going through...

14:01.560 --> 14:03.530
That really shook me up.

14:07.060 --> 14:08.660
What might be troubling...

14:08.770 --> 14:11.430
...a certain student, and
how badly he's hurting...

14:11.570 --> 14:15.400
The truth is, not even
teachers can ever really tell...

14:16.510 --> 14:19.710
After I left my job, I took
my deeply wounded heart and...

14:19.840 --> 14:21.280
...set off on a journey.

14:21.380 --> 14:22.310
A journey?

14:22.450 --> 14:23.380
That's right.

14:23.950 --> 14:26.420
I just wandered aimlessly
going as far north as Hokkaido...

14:26.520 --> 14:28.110
...and as far south as Guam.

14:28.220 --> 14:29.240
Vacation, you mean.

14:29.350 --> 14:31.120
That's just a vacation you took!

14:41.000 --> 14:41.760
Ready!

14:41.870 --> 14:43.230
All right, here I come!

14:43.330 --> 14:44.130
Take that!

14:45.240 --> 14:46.260
Wait up!

14:47.300 --> 14:51.670
After a while, it hit me that I
really did want to teach after all.

14:53.340 --> 14:57.480
And since then, I've felt that as
a teacher, I could take on anything!

15:02.120 --> 15:04.350
Not gonna go through that crap again!

15:04.460 --> 15:07.080
I have no fear.
I'll do anything for my students!

15:07.190 --> 15:08.920
That's what I decided!

15:09.060 --> 15:11.260
Even the ones who look like goons!

15:11.830 --> 15:14.630
I see now. I knew she had
a humongous chest...

15:14.730 --> 15:17.260
...but her heart's extra-large too.

15:21.970 --> 15:24.100
Ichikawa bailed on us.

15:24.210 --> 15:27.800
Who knew that little prick
had the balls not to show up!

15:27.910 --> 15:29.780
Tomorrow, he's gonna get his, right?

15:36.820 --> 15:37.880
Dammit!

15:38.720 --> 15:40.490
It's all because of her!

15:46.760 --> 15:48.060
So...

15:48.230 --> 15:52.070
I never knew Ms. Fujiyama
had a history like that.

15:52.570 --> 15:54.660
She's gone through
some rough times.

15:54.910 --> 16:01.280
I guess that's what the principal was
talking about when he said she was tough.

16:01.410 --> 16:02.470
Hey, man!

16:02.580 --> 16:03.310
Huh?

16:07.990 --> 16:11.050
How come you're spacing out
'stead of teaching?

16:12.460 --> 16:13.620
Sorry, sorry.

16:13.720 --> 16:14.710
Time for class...

16:14.830 --> 16:17.290
This teacher's a major retard,
I'm telling you.

16:17.390 --> 16:19.090
You're the retard, you dickhead.

16:19.200 --> 16:20.100
What do you mean?

16:20.200 --> 16:21.830
She's gonna start class now, duh!

16:21.930 --> 16:23.560
Oh, shit!

16:23.700 --> 16:24.960
You're so dead, man!

16:25.070 --> 16:26.300
Oh, man!

16:26.800 --> 16:31.110
You'd think these guys were
strangers to any kind of anguish...

16:32.610 --> 16:37.570
But I guess they must have
their share of hang-ups.

16:38.180 --> 16:40.120
What might be troubling...

16:40.250 --> 16:42.910
...a certain student, and
how badly he's hurting...

16:43.050 --> 16:45.580
That's what Ms. Fujiyama told me...

16:48.390 --> 16:51.260
Even if it seems like a
trivial matter to others...

16:51.400 --> 16:55.360
It could very well mean life or
death for the kid in question.

16:59.600 --> 17:01.570
All right! Listen up!

17:02.310 --> 17:05.070
We're canceling class.
Let's play some soccer!

17:05.210 --> 17:06.180
Jeez!

17:06.440 --> 17:08.910
What the hell?
What's this all of a sudden?

17:09.550 --> 17:12.380
You need to sweat,
to throw yourselves into sports!

17:12.520 --> 17:15.080
That will vanquish
your adolescent angst!

17:15.320 --> 17:15.910
Huh?

17:16.020 --> 17:17.320
Adolescent angst?

17:17.450 --> 17:19.690
What the hell have you
been smoking, moron?

17:19.820 --> 17:21.880
If you wanna play soccer,
play by yourself!

17:21.990 --> 17:25.430
No one else here is
as retarded as you!

17:26.430 --> 17:28.760
Either we play soccer, or
I'll give you a math test.

17:28.870 --> 17:30.200
It's your call!

17:32.770 --> 17:34.000
All right, all right, all right.

17:34.100 --> 17:35.160
Out of the way!

17:35.470 --> 17:36.130
Watch this!

17:36.240 --> 17:37.170
Move it!

17:40.080 --> 17:40.810
All right!

17:40.940 --> 17:42.810
Kinoshita! Run, run!

17:43.410 --> 17:44.810
Okay, I'm coming, I'm coming.

17:44.950 --> 17:45.850
You're too slow!

17:45.950 --> 17:47.040
Pass it back to me!

17:48.150 --> 17:49.520
Hey, come on, Yankumi!

17:49.620 --> 17:51.710
For chrissake, that's so offside!

17:52.160 --> 17:53.250
Up yours!

17:53.360 --> 17:55.590
You can just fuhgeddabout
that offside crap!

17:55.690 --> 17:57.060
Goddammit...

17:57.930 --> 17:59.560
Hey, there goes Shin!

17:59.660 --> 18:01.260
Attaboy! Stop that moron!

18:06.370 --> 18:08.570
Kuma! Get up off your ass!

18:12.510 --> 18:13.440
Gotcha!

18:13.880 --> 18:15.040
Too slow.

18:15.150 --> 18:16.640
Wrong side, too.

18:16.750 --> 18:17.540
Shit!

18:19.850 --> 18:22.150
Hey, let's do it for real this time.

18:22.420 --> 18:22.940
Oh?

18:23.050 --> 18:24.350
You want another go?

18:24.820 --> 18:25.480
Shit!

18:26.120 --> 18:27.520
What's up with that bitch?

18:27.620 --> 18:29.120
How come she's so damn good?

18:29.230 --> 18:31.200
She said something about
our adolescent angst...

18:31.300 --> 18:33.290
...but I bet she just
wanted to play soccer.

18:33.600 --> 18:34.090
Huh?

18:34.300 --> 18:35.290
Holy shit!

18:35.700 --> 18:36.290
Jeez!

18:36.700 --> 18:37.530
Oh my God!

18:37.670 --> 18:38.400
Yankumi!

18:38.500 --> 18:40.160
Look! Up on the roof!

18:50.780 --> 18:52.180
Huh? It's that kid!

18:52.350 --> 18:53.680
Ichikawa!

18:59.920 --> 19:02.050
He's not planning to jump, is he?

19:02.190 --> 19:04.960
Damn! I don't want to
be around to see that!

19:06.230 --> 19:07.420
Ichikawa!

19:08.330 --> 19:11.130
Ichikawa, get behind the railing!

19:12.640 --> 19:13.600
It's no use.

19:14.070 --> 19:16.060
We're not reaching him at all.

19:20.780 --> 19:22.910
Bring it on, Ichikawa-kun!

19:24.110 --> 19:25.100
Ms. Fujiyama?

19:25.280 --> 19:26.910
What are you doing?

19:27.020 --> 19:30.010
I'm going to catch you
if you fall from there!

19:30.720 --> 19:31.420
Are...

19:31.590 --> 19:32.560
Are you crazy?

19:32.660 --> 19:35.420
If you try to catch me,
you might end up getting killed, too!

19:35.660 --> 19:36.990
I know that!

19:37.230 --> 19:40.930
But I'd rather die trying than
just stand here and not do anything!

19:41.230 --> 19:42.290
Ms. Fujiyama...

19:42.430 --> 19:45.930
Besides, if I catch you
with my ample bosom...

19:46.270 --> 19:48.900
...then at least you
might survive, right?

19:49.010 --> 19:50.870
That's not such a bad deal.

19:50.970 --> 19:52.470
Not a bad deal at all...

19:52.580 --> 19:53.940
You little dumbasses!

19:54.040 --> 19:57.210
Ms. Fujiyama,
keep talking to him like that.

20:00.150 --> 20:04.680
I wasn't really thinking
about killing myself.

20:05.120 --> 20:08.420
I just started walking,
and found myself here.

20:08.530 --> 20:11.590
Okay, I believe you.

20:11.800 --> 20:15.160
Please, get back behind
the railing, then!

20:15.570 --> 20:16.430
Okay.

20:31.620 --> 20:33.110
All right! Gotcha!

20:33.420 --> 20:34.180
Uh-oh...

20:34.990 --> 20:36.420
Oh, shit!

20:36.550 --> 20:37.890
Can't reach...

20:39.860 --> 20:41.050
Goddamn you!

20:41.190 --> 20:42.990
Don't just rush in blindly!

20:43.090 --> 20:44.030
Shin Sawada...

20:44.130 --> 20:44.860
Chrissake!

20:44.960 --> 20:46.550
You're just gonna add
to the death toll.

20:46.660 --> 20:47.930
Y-you're all here...

20:55.270 --> 20:56.570
Ichikawa!

20:56.740 --> 20:58.470
M-Ms. Fujiyama!

21:00.340 --> 21:01.540
Thank goodness!

21:01.650 --> 21:02.740
You didn't fall...

21:04.580 --> 21:06.710
Ms. Fujiyama...

21:07.450 --> 21:08.610
I...

21:33.640 --> 21:34.440
Yes?

21:36.010 --> 21:38.810
Um, we saw your poster, see...

21:39.450 --> 21:41.320
We'd like to join the club.

21:43.250 --> 21:48.320
We're the four seniors known as
the Big Boobs-Lovin' Quartet!

21:48.430 --> 21:52.950
No-no...
NO!

22:07.810 --> 22:17.810
<i>We are all born</i>
<i>crying out to the world.</i>

22:18.860 --> 22:28.790
<i>Because of all the endless grief</i>
<i>that we must go through in life.</i>

22:29.570 --> 22:39.270
<i>All of the heartache</i>
<i>is such a heavy load to bear.</i>

22:39.580 --> 22:44.480
<i>On those days when</i>
<i>I am alone and cold...</i>

22:44.710 --> 22:49.620
<i>...I'll light a fire</i>
<i>with my own two hands.</i>

22:50.050 --> 22:54.990
<i>The treacherous mountains</i>
<i>are my chosen path.</i>

22:55.160 --> 23:01.930
<i>I'll keep moving forward</i>
<i>without a backward glance.</i>

23:19.150 --> 23:22.880
I don't know, falsetto
just doesn't do it for me.

23:23.020 --> 23:26.390
Real men belt out
those enka songs in the...

23:26.490 --> 23:29.020
...traditional style,
know what I'm saying?

23:29.260 --> 23:29.950
Huh?

23:30.090 --> 23:32.360
Ojou, where are you going?

23:32.700 --> 23:33.290
What?

23:33.400 --> 23:34.960
You want me to stay home?

23:35.070 --> 23:36.930
Come on, gimme a break!

23:37.800 --> 23:41.430
Next episode:
The Class Trip into Hell Begins!

23:41.740 --> 23:44.370
There's something
waiting to happen there...

23:44.540 --> 23:46.270
What can it be?
